    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d27">

                <pb facs="0134" n="38" sameAs="frus:frus1900/pg38"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Hay to Mr. Townsend</hi>.</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1900-06-15"><hi rendition="#italic">June 15,
                        1900</hi></date>.</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 46.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: In reply to your No. 55, of the 1st
                    instant, you are informed that on the 7th instant the Senate of the United
                    States adjourned sine die, without having taken action on the convention
                    regulating the sale of spirituous liquors in Africa, signed on the 8th of June
                    of last year.</p>
                <p>I am, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">John Hay</hi>.</signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
